request.description:
### ⭐ Filter Books by Minimum Rating

একটি নির্দিষ্ট মানের বা তার চেয়ে বেশি রেটিংয়ের বইগুলো ফিল্টার করতে `minRating` কুয়েরি প্যারামিটার ব্যবহার করুন।

---

#### 📌 Query Parameters:
| Parameter | Type | Required | Description | Example |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `minRating` | Number | Yes | সর্বনিম্ন রেটিং | `4.8`, `4.5`, `4.0` |

---

#### 💻 Example Code:

##### 1. cURL
```bash
curl -X GET "http://localhost:4020/api/books?minRating=4.8"
```

##### 2. JavaScript (Fetch API)
```javascript
async function getTopRatedBooks(minRating = 4.8) {
  const res = await fetch(`http://localhost:4020/api/books?minRating=${minRating}`);
  const data = await res.json();
  console.log(data);
}
getTopRatedBooks(4.8);
```

---

#### 📤 Expected Response (`200 OK`):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "count": 3,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Clean Code",
      "rating": 4.8
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Atomic Habits",
      "rating": 4.9
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Sapiens: A Brief History",
      "rating": 4.8
    }
  ]
}
```

### 📊 Sort Books by Rating (Highest First)

সর্বোচ্চ রেটিংপ্রাপ্ত বইগুলো সবার উপরে প্রদর্শন করতে `sort=rating` ব্যবহার করুন।

---

#### 📌 Query Parameters:
| Parameter | Type | Required | Allowed Values | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `sort` | String | Yes | `rating`, `newest`, `oldest` | সর্টিংয়ের মানদণ্ড |

---

#### 💻 Example Code:

##### 1. cURL
```bash
curl -X GET "http://localhost:4020/api/books?sort=rating"
```

##### 2. JavaScript (Fetch API)
```javascript
async function getBooksSortedByRating() {
  const res = await fetch('http://localhost:4020/api/books?sort=rating');
  const data = await res.json();
  console.log(data);
}
getBooksSortedByRating();
```

---

#### 📤 Expected Response (`200 OK`):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "count": 50,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Atomic Habits",
      "rating": 4.9
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Clean Code",
      "rating": 4.8
    }
  ]
}
```

