request.description:
### 📖 Get Book by ID (Success)

ডাটাবেস থেকে একটি সুনির্দিষ্ট বইয়ের সমস্ত তথ্য তার ইউনিক `id` দ্বারা রিট্রিভ করতে এই এন্ডপয়েন্টটি ব্যবহার করা হয়।

---

#### 📌 Path Parameters:
| Parameter | Type | Required | Description | Example |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | Integer | Yes | বইয়ের আইডি (Primary Key) | `1`, `2`, `3` |

---

#### 💻 Example Code:

##### 1. cURL
```bash
curl -X GET http://localhost:4020/api/books/1
```

##### 2. JavaScript (Fetch API)
```javascript
async function getBookById(id) {
  const res = await fetch(`http://localhost:4020/api/books/${id}`);
  if (!res.ok) {
    throw new Error(`Failed to fetch book: ${res.status}`);
  }
  const data = await res.json();
  console.log(data);
}
getBookById(1);
```

---

#### 📤 Expected Response (`200 OK`):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Clean Code",
    "author": "Sumit Saha",
    "genre": "Tech",
    "rating": 4.8,
    "publishedYear": 2024,
    "description": "A handbook of agile software craftsmanship for building clean, maintainable, and elegant code.",
    "coverImage": "assets/images/clean-code.svg",
    "price": "$34.99"
  }
}
```

